  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Rip-Stop BDU Shorts are built for action&mdash;from the trail to the range and everything in between. Crafted from a rugged cotton rip-stop fabric, the military cargo shorts offer tear-resistant durability, breathable comfort, and tactical utility. With 6 pockets, adjustable waist tabs, and a secure button fly, these tactical BDU shorts are trusted by first responders, law enforcement, outdoor adventurers, and everyday operators who need performance-ready gear that won't back down.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "5795",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Rip-Stop BDU Shorts are built for action&mdash;from the trail to the range and everything in between. Crafted from a rugged cotton rip-stop fabric, the cargo shorts offer tear-resistant durability, breathable comfort, and tactical utility. With 6 pockets, adjustable waist tabs, and a secure button fly, these tactical BDU shorts are trusted by first responders, law enforcement, outdoor adventurers, and everyday operators who need performance-ready gear that won't back down. Rugged Construction: Engineered for resilience, our Rip-Stop BDU shorts are made from durable, breathable rip-stop cotton that resists tears, withstands abrasion, and keeps you cool in demanding environments. Trusted by first responders, law enforcement, tactical operators, and outdoor adventurers, these cargo shorts are built to perform when conditions get tough. High-Capacity Storage: The hiking shorts provide functional utility through 2 large cargo pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for storing tactical gear and everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, keys, or multi-tool. Comfortable Button Fly: These tactical cargo shorts come equipped with a button fly for easy on and off, along with a secure fit during outdoor adventures. Perfect Fit: The adjustable waist tabs are designed to give you the perfect, custom fit, every time and anywhere. Upgrade your tactical loadout with these incredible rip-stop cargo shorts. Action Ready: Initially designed for active-duty personnel and tactical professionals, these adaptable and reliable BDU uniform shorts are great for backpacking, camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, working, public safety, skateboarding, everyday wear, and more. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete your look with one of our many T-Shirts from solid color to camouflage pattens and graphic designs. Go ahead and throw on one our Low Profile Caps or Boonie Hats.</p>",
